   "title": "Ml Exercise Guide",
   "text": "Assignment 3: Preventing Data Leakage\nTask. A student standardizes the whole dataset, then splits it into train and test sets. What is wrong?\nExpected answer. The scaler computed the mean and standard deviation using the test rows, so information from the test set leaked into the training pipeline. The correct procedure is to split first, fit the scaler on the training set only and apply the fitted scaler to the test set. Using a scikit-learn Pipeline inside cross-validation automates this.",
   "doc_id": "ml_exercise_guide",
